        <mxCell id="R9d-7NJiSH4ExI2Srzwc-102" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;woltApplyGift&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Run Selenium to apply the code for the user&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Handler: dist/handlers/automation/woltApplyGift.handler&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Trigger:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Timeout:&amp;nbsp;120 seconds&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Runtime: Docker image: &quot;woltflow-selenium-image&quot;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;MemorySize:&amp;nbsp;1536 MB&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;EphemeralStorageSize:&lt;span style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;1536 MB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;strokeColor=default;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
